From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:03:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] Sheathe weapons on the back and hips; X draws and
 sheathes

Melee weapons ride a mount bone (spine_03 for the back, the pelvis for
the hips) when not in use: greatsword and axe across the back, katana at
the left hip, dagger at the right. Attacking, guarding, an art, a
lock-on or X draws (the hand reaches for the grip; the weapon changes
hands at 0.2 s, before any active frames); X, 8 s out of the fight or a
tool in hand sheathes. WeaponDef.carry overrides the default mount.
Intent gains sheathe_pressed (X) and grab_pressed (G).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017RTuqxaQfwuvFPEJrcXYEk
